## Checklist

- [ ] The linked issue describes the defect and how to reproduce it.
- [ ] A test fails before the fix and passes after it.
- [ ] The change does nothing beyond what the fix needs.
- [ ] No kit file names, detects or special-cases a repository, path, command, toolchain or policy.
- [ ] The kit adds no gate of its own; consumer-declared checks remain the consumer's.
- [ ] No new input, secret, file, tool, version floor or manual step is required of consumers.

Review against [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/randlee/sc-publish/blob/develop/CONTRIBUTING.md) is requested.
